# ==============================================================================
# WENDORO ERP — OPTIONAL ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Zero keys are required for initial Cloudflare, Docker, or Node deployment.
# Deploy first with one click, then add keys ONLY when enabling those features:
#   - Cloudflare: Dashboard -> Workers & Pages -> Settings -> Variables & Secrets
#                 or CLI: `npx wrangler secret put <KEY>`
#   - Docker/VPS: Copy this file to `.env` and uncomment only the keys you use.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Server-Side Secrets (NEVER prefix with VITE_ or commit real values) ---
# GEMINI_API_KEY=""
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://wendoro:change_me@localhost:5432/wendoro"
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=""
# LICENSE_SIGNING_SECRET=""
# APP_URL="https://erp.example.com"

# --- Optional Client-Side Firebase Config (Google Sign-In & Firestore Presence) ---
# Alternatively, copy firebase-applet-config.example.json -> firebase-applet-config.json (gitignored).
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=""
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=""
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=""
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=""
# VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=""
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=""
# VITE_FIREBASE_FIRESTORE_DATABASE_ID="(default)"
